WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.9 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Writing usable procedures

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Write procedures now, even for tasks only you do, so others can take them over as you grow.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Set trigger, owner, steps, records and exceptions.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Test it with someone who did not write it.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Base emergency and safeguarding steps on local advice.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft one priority procedure for your launch and plan its test.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
